e":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162966291,"discussion_id":"fc821a06d145a318ec59b96990099ae7f65f7768","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-11T20:38:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-11T20:38:01+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162966338,"discussion_id":"cb03acbf74c95d16a109d39373f8ca2400670324","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化最大池化算子（max_pool_v3）内核的代码结构。原代码使用预处理器宏（`#if`）进行条件编译，导致代码分支分散，可读性和可维护性较差。重构的目标是消除编译期分支，统一调度逻辑，同时确保算子功能完全不变。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是将算子内核入口函数中基于 `TILING_KEY_X` 宏的静态条件编译，重构为使用 `TILING_KEY_IS` 宏的运行时 `if-else` 链式判断。该方案统一了处理不同数据格式（NCHW/NHWC）和内核类型（大/小/带填充）的代码路径，使整体逻辑更加清晰、集中，便于后续的调试、测试与功能扩展。","created_at":"2026-02-11T20:38:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-11T20:38:32+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162966339,"discussion_id":"33735412d1495af4568825a66c974ef6cc851a61","body":"### 代码格式问题: 文件末尾缺少换行符（No newline at end of file）。虽然这不影响功能，但不符合代码规范，可能在某些工具处理时产生警告。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码格式问题\n**文件路径**: `pooling/max_pool_v3/op_kernel/max_pool_v3_apt.cpp`\n**行号**: 65\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\n    }\n}\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n在文件末尾添加一个换行符。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-